0011: # description:
0012: # In the input you will individual pixels are the sides of a grid. Each pixel is in a matching pair, which is a different color, but on the opposite side of the grid.
0013: # To make the output, make each pixel copy its color toward its matching pair until they meet in the middle. Turn the middle point grey.
